jobs.description:
Logistics employee 
 Over de functie 
 Become a Logistics Employee in Den Bosch! ✨ 
Are you looking for a logistics job and do you already have some experience? Then this is your opportunity! We are looking for an Order Picker for the My Jewellery distribution center in Den Bosch. You'll work 40 hours per week in a fixed two-shift schedule: 
06:00 AM - 03:00 PM 
03:00 PM - 12:00 AM 
 The shifts alternate weekly. Jouw nieuwe werkplek 
 As an Order Picker, you play an important role in the logistics process. You ensure that customer orders are picked accurately and prepared for shipment. Using a handheld scanner and an order cart, you'll move through the warehouse collecting the right products. Thanks to your attention to detail, customers receive their orders complete and on time. 
Pick orders using a handheld scanner 
Deliver products to the packing department 
Check items for completeness and quality 
Assist with processing returns 
 Dit bieden wij jou 
 ✅ An attractive hourly wage of €16.18 , including shift allowance (approximately €2,800 gross per month based on 40 hours); 
✅ A clear and fixed work schedule; 
✅ A modern warehouse with a great working atmosphere; 
✅ A young and enthusiastic team; 
✅ Career growth opportunities, for example towards Operator or Inventory Controller positions; 
✅ The opportunity to obtain a Forklift or Reach Truck Certificate; 
✅ Travel allowance and free safety shoes through Westerduin; 
✅ Holiday pay, paid vacation days, and pension accrual; 
✅ Healthy meals available through the AH to go vending machine. 
 Dit vragen wij van jou 
 ✔ Available to start immediately; 
✔ At least 2 years of logistics experience; 
✔ Good command of Dutch or English. 
 Solliciteren 
 Interested? 
Great to hear you're interested in this Logistics Employee position in Den Bosch! 
Call or WhatsApp Romy at +31659888684 to schedule an appointment. 
We hope to speak with you soon! 
